  "text": "Microphone settings\n\nPreferred microphone\n\nChoose which microphone mausVoice should use when recording. Automatic picks the best available device each time.\n\nMicrophone\n\nAutomatic\n\nRecommended\nMicrophone\nRefresh devices\nKeep the microphone ready\n\nStart dictating instantly by opening the microphone ahead of time. Your system shows its microphone-in-use indicator the whole time this is on.\n\nHeld open now.\n\nAudio kept before the press\n\n0.5 s\nHow much speech to keep from just before you press, so a word you start early is not cut off.\nStay ready after a dictation\n\nAlready on, because the microphone is kept ready.\n\nTest your microphone\n\nStart a short test to see live audio levels and play back what was recorded.\n\nRecord\nPlay\nClose\nSave changes",
